<h3>Event T-Shirt</h3>
<p>Special marathon event T-shirt for participants.</p>
</div>

<div class="benefit">
<div class="visual">🏅</div>
<h3>Finisher Medal</h3>
<p>A memorable medal for every participant.</p>
</div>

<div class="benefit">
<div class="visual">📜</div>
<h3>Certificate</h3>
<p>Certificate of participation for every runner.</p>
</div>

<div class="benefit">
<div class="visual">🍱</div>
<h3>Breakfast</h3>
<p>Breakfast provided for participants after the run.</p>
</div>

<div class="benefit">
<div class="visual">🥤</div>
<h3>Refreshments</h3>
<p>Refreshments to help you recover after your run.</p>
</div>

<div class="benefit">
<div class="visual">🏥</div>
<h3>Medical Facilities</h3>
<p>Medical support and first-aid facilities at the event.</p>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- PRIZES -->
<section class="prize-section" id="prizes">
<div class="container">

<div class="section-label">CASH PRIZES</div>
<h2 class="section-title">PRIZE DETAILS</h2>

<div class="prize-note">
💰 TOTAL CASH PRIZE — ₹2,10,000
</div>

<div class="tabs">
<button class="tab active" onclick="showPrize('adults',this)">ADULTS</button>
<button class="tab" onclick="showPrize('kids',this)">KIDS</button>
</div>

<div id="adults">

<div class="prize-card">
<h3>🥇 14 KM – OPEN MEN</h3>
