</div>

<div class="prize-card">
<h3>👦 1 KM – BOYS / GIRLS (BELOW 8 YEARS)</h3>
<div class="prize-row"><b>1st</b><span class="amount">₹2,000</span></div>
<div class="prize-row"><b>2nd</b><span class="amount">₹1,500</span></div>
<div class="prize-row"><b>3rd</b><span class="amount">₹1,250</span></div>
<div class="prize-row"><b>4th</b><span class="amount">₹1,000</span></div>
<div class="prize-row"><b>5th</b><span class="amount">₹750</span></div>
